<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Day by day,</l><l>Our inward parts are being renewed by the Lord;</l><l>Every day,</l><l>Fresh and rich supply to us He does afford.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Here a little,</l><l>And there a little, Christ reveals Himself to us;</l><l>When we read His word,</l><l>We are satisfied and we enjoy Him thus.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Morning by morning,</l><l>Jehovah He is faithful to awaken us;</l><l>He instructs our ears,</l><l>With just a word, the weary to sustain we must.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>From strength to strength,</l><l>We’re on the highways to enter into our God;</l><l>Though Satan opposes,</l><l>We are strengthened to lay hold of more of God.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Grace upon grace,</l><l>The Triune God is processed for us to enjoy;</l><l>The law is over,</l><l>Now we can partake of His supply through grace.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>From glory to glory,</l><l>We are in the process of being transformed;</l><l>Beholding, reflecting,</l><l>To God’s image with all saints we’ll be conformed.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
